  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 20,
    "dDurationMs": 6440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What do this satellite thruster, plastic\ntool, and micro mechanical switch have in common?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6640,
    "dDurationMs": 4360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well they all contain components\nthat bend, so-called compliant mechanisms"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 11000,
    "dDurationMs": 4840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This episode was sponsored by SimpliSafe. More about them at the end of the show."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 15840,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now about a month ago I was giving\na talk in Utah"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 18750,
    "dDurationMs": 4710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "hence the suit and that's where I met\nthis guy, -Larry Howell professor of mechanical engineering."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 23540,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it's always been considered to be bad to have"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 26609,
    "dDurationMs": 4680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "flexibility in your in your machines.\nWell we've tried to take that that thing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 31289,
    "dDurationMs": 5221,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that everybody hates, that is trying to\navoid and say how can we use flexibility"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 36510,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to our advantage? how can we use that to\ndo cool stuff?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 40110,
    "dDurationMs": 4050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now Professor Howell literally wrote the\nbook on compliant mechanisms -that's the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 44160,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "most cited book\n-but he's pretty nonchalant about his work"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 48240,
    "dDurationMs": 4049,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just watch how he introduces this mechanism he developed to prevent nuclear weapons"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 52289,
    "dDurationMs": 1671,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from going off accidentally:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 53960,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "actually in safing and arming of nuclear weapons."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 57400,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so if... \n-What?\n-Yeah"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 59560,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so if you want....\n-Hang on, hang on hang on"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 61920,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What-ing nuclear weapons?\n-Safing and arming"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 65120,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Safing and arming \n-yeah so if there's anything in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 68790,
    "dDurationMs": 5130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the world that you want to be safe it's\nnot going to accidentally go off"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 73920,
    "dDurationMs": 4710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I feel like this is - it doesn't even need saying\nbut yes nuclear weapons obviously you don't"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 78630,
    "dDurationMs": 3690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "want them to go off. What I don't\nunderstand how this is gonna keep the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 82320,
    "dDurationMs": 1060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "nuclear weapons safe."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 83380,
    "dDurationMs": 2629,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now I want to come\nback to this device and explain how it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 86009,
    "dDurationMs": 4860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "works once we understand why compliant\nmechanisms are best suited to this task"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 90869,
    "dDurationMs": 2451,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[that's cool] So let's start with\nsomething basic."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 93320,
    "dDurationMs": 670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Probably the first"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 93990,
    "dDurationMs": 6419,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "compliant mechanism I ever designed was\nthis thing. What it is is a compliant"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 100409,
    "dDurationMs": 5011,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "mechanism that is a gripper so you can\nput something in there and it will get"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 105420,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "actually a really high force. I can put\nthat in there and and it breaks the chalk"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 111420,
    "dDurationMs": 3989,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What have you put your finger in\nthere and squeeze it? You would scream in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 115409,
    "dDurationMs": 4111,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "pain, would you like to try? -I would like\nI would actually like to feel the force"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 119520,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "OK, you need to squeeze it yourself though or it's...\n-Really?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 123820,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "well all right, I'll squeeze until you scream in pain"
