  }, {
    "tStartMs": 127480,
    "dDurationMs": 1700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Aaahh hahaha"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 129200,
    "dDurationMs": 7360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That very quickly got incredibly painful it felt\nlike having my finger like in a in a vice."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 136560,
    "dDurationMs": 6180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That looks suspiciously like vice\ngrips but now with these flexible"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 142740,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "components where the hinges are."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 145740,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What I learned in my visit with Professor Howell"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 147840,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is that compliant mechanisms have a\nnumber of advantages over traditional"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 151260,
    "dDurationMs": 5430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "mechanisms but I thought he needed kind\nof a clever pithy way to remember all of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 156690,
    "dDurationMs": 5490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "these advantages. So I came up with the\neighth P's of compliant mechanisms and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 162180,
    "dDurationMs": 5309,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the first of those is Part count.\nCompliant mechanisms have reduced part"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 167489,
    "dDurationMs": 3871,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "count because they have these bendy\nparts instead of having things like"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 171360,
    "dDurationMs": 5640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "hinges and bearings and separate springs.\nThis gripper is just a single piece of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 177000,
    "dDurationMs": 4290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "plastic but achieves a similar result to\nthe much more complicated vice grips."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 181290,
    "dDurationMs": 4890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like how much does it amplify the force?\nThis will get about thirty to one so I"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 186180,
    "dDurationMs": 4380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "could get for one pound force in, get\nthirty pounds out. That's pretty good"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 190560,
    "dDurationMs": 5670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It seems like that would be super cheap \n-and really inexpensive so this we just made"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 196230,
    "dDurationMs": 3129,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "here in our shop but you can imagine\nalso injection molding that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 199359,
    "dDurationMs": 2921,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- that would cost like cents \n-yep this would cost cents"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 202280,
    "dDurationMs": 1450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the other thing is because of its shape"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 203730,
    "dDurationMs": 5030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you could extrude it and then just chop\nthem off and that would be cool."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 208760,
    "dDurationMs": 1479,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the simple design allows"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 210239,
    "dDurationMs": 5191,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "different production processes to be\nused which lowers the price these"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 215430,
    "dDurationMs": 3450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "switches for example achieve in one\npiece of plastic what is normally done"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 218880,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with springs, hinges and many rigid\nplastic pieces"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 222480,
    "dDurationMs": 1880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "also a good fidget device"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 224360,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "how long can these last?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 226040,
    "dDurationMs": 3550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "-we've had these in\nour fatigue testing machine. We've been"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 229590,
    "dDurationMs": 2842,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "able to go over a million cycles without\nfailure"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 232440,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What have we got there?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 233820,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All right, Derek I've got a quiz \n-uh oh"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 236180,
    "dDurationMs": 4060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "quiz for you okay, I'm gonna \n-elephant I'm gonna"
