  }, {
    "tStartMs": 278630,
    "dDurationMs": 3690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "good thinking? that's well it's\nthinking at least so... this is designed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 282320,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so that when you push on that it\nactually just rotates in space it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 286640,
    "dDurationMs": 3220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "doesn't move at all.\n-I knew you were gonna pull some sort of trick"
