  }, {
    "tStartMs": 315410,
    "dDurationMs": 4730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in a wind tunnel. don't displace it but be able to change the angle."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 320140,
    "dDurationMs": 3640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Devices like this demonstrate that\ncompliant mechanisms are capable of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 323780,
    "dDurationMs": 4890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "producing very precise motion, which I\npersonally found pretty counterintuitive"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 328670,
    "dDurationMs": 2890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because these objects are made up of\nflexible parts"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 331560,
    "dDurationMs": 1640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but maybe that shouldn't"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 333200,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "be surprising because compliant\nmechanisms don't suffer from backlash"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 337400,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for one thing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 338400,
    "dDurationMs": 2990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So backlash occurs when\nyou have a hinge which is basically just"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 341390,
    "dDurationMs": 5700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a pin in a hole and it's moving in one\ndirection and now if at some point the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 347090,
    "dDurationMs": 4110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "motion reverses it doesn't happen\ninstantaneously because there's some"
